      "widgets_values": [
        "# Natural Editorial Image Finish\n\nUse `Select Images` to choose one or more source files, then press `Batch Process` or the main ComfyUI Run button. Images are processed serially and saved as `<source folder>/HD/<same filename>`; an existing same-name HD result is replaced.\n\nRequired ComfyUI: `0.20.1+`\n\nModels:\n- `models/checkpoints/juggernautXL_v9Rdphoto2Lightning.safetensors`\n- `models/model_patches/SUPIR-v0Q_fp16.safetensors`\n- `models/checkpoints/epicphotogasm_ultimateFidelity.safetensors`\n\nPipeline: SUPIR restoration -> low source-color protection -> epiCPhotoGasm SD 1.5 low-denoise texture pass -> natural tone -> restrained sharpness -> fine grain.\n\nepiCPhotoGasm is an independent SD 1.5 stage and must not replace the SDXL checkpoint used by SUPIR.\n\nLicense: SUPIR is restricted to non-commercial use unless separately authorized. epiCPhotoGasm requires creator credit; follow the Civitai model permissions and do not redistribute the checkpoint."
      ]
    }
